      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "9.6 grams of fat. Saturated fat is 2.2 grams, which is a little heavy for a tuber food. Polyunsaturated fat is 2.8 grams, helping a little with useful unsaturated fat. Fat isn't the main job for tubers though.",
