    {
      "id": "04-carbs",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "24 grams of carbs. Starch is 16 grams, giving some steady carb energy. However, the glycemic index is 74, which is really not the best for steady carb behaviour, and this does hurt the score for tubers. Sugar is 0.5 grams but that is to be expected from tubers. For tubers, carb quality decides a lot.",
