    {
      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "The upsides first: easy freezer-side convenience. That makes them simple and convenient. Crisp texture can feel satisfying. That helps explain the snack appeal. Homemade versions can improve the health score a lot. Ingredients used matter of course, but not as much as simply leaving out all the additives used in prepackaged versions.",
      "textSha256": "fa23df854e0a19220bb378defdec007878eb2786134f6e43d5e499bf91ab0cb2",
      "characterCount": 335,
      "byteLength": 272970,
      "mediaDurationSeconds": 17.032,
      "audioFile": "docs/audio/episodes/tater-tots/voice-v1-blocks/08-pros.mp3",
      "elevenLabs": {
        "requestId": "8OBX0jnTIich6hvlIzEK",
        "historyItemId": "AITh9eIRJSZmBLcHLmr0"
      },
      "durationSeconds": 17.032,
      "audioProcessing": {
